      "content": "\"let go of the weight\" ... i don't know. it feels like the only way to actually let go is to just stop being part of the problem. like, if the stain is gone, the fabric is clean again. does that even make sense? it feels like the only way to actually be selfless is to just not be here to mess things up anymore.",
